==English==

===Etymology===
{{etyl|yi|en}} {{m|yi|שפּריץ|tr=shprits}} (the noun) and {{m|yi|שפּריצן|tr=shpritsn}} (the verb).

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/spɹɪts/|/ʃpɹɪts/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|en-us-spritz.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ɪts|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|es}}

# A [[sprinkling]] or [[spray]] of [[liquid]]; a small amount of liquid.
#: ''Fish is good with a '''spritz''' of lemon juice.''

====Translations====
{{trans-top|sprinkling or spray of liquid}}
* German: {{t+|de|Spritzer|m}}, {{t+|de|Schuss|m}}
